- `multiplyMatrices`: Multiplies two matrices under modulo p.
- `matrixPower`: Raises a matrix to the power of n under modulo p using exponentiation by squaring.
- `fibonacciMod`: Uses matrix exponentiation to find the nth Fibonacci number modulo p.

